## Flows
{% for f in c.summary.flows %}
- {{ f.flow_key }}: {{ f.status }} ({{ f.step_count }} steps, {{ (f.duration_ms / 1000) | round(1) }}s, {{ f.findings }} findings){% if f.failure_reason %} - {{ f.failure_reason }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

## Requirements coverage
{% for r in c.requirements %}
- {{ r.key }} {{ r.title }}: {{ r.status }}{% if r.finding_ids %} ({{ r.finding_ids | length }} findings){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

## Findings by category
{% for cat, items in c.findings_by_category.items() %}
### {{ cat }}
{% for f in items %}
- [{{ f.severity }}] {{ f.title }} ({{ f.flow }}, step {{ f.step_seq }}){% if f.judged_by != "code" %} judged by {{ f.judged_by }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

## Performance
{% for n in c.performance.slowest_api_calls %}
- {{ n.method }} {{ n.url }}: {{ n.duration_ms }}ms (HTTP {{ n.status }})
{% endfor %}
{% for w in c.performance.longest_waits %}
- Wait in {{ w.flow }} step {{ w.step_seq }}: {{ w.settle_ms }}ms
{% endfor %}

## Recommendations
